# Forgekit — Claude Code Integration

This project uses [Forgekit](https://github.com/rapoii/forgekit) for structured development.

## Auto-Trigger Rules

When the user expresses intent to build something NEW, load the `forgekit-bootstrap` skill FIRST:
- "mau bikin X", "mau buat X", "I want to build X"
- "bikin website", "bikin app", "bikin bot"
- "/forgekit", "forgekit start"

## Skills Location
Load skills from: `.claude/skills/forgekit-*/SKILL.md`

## Pipeline
constitution → brainstorm → clarify → specify → analyze → checklist → plan → tdd → tasks → implement → review → verify → converge → finish
